// 1:1 port of the core math/data helpers from tinygrad/helpers.py.
// NOTE: rss integer `/` and `%` truncate toward zero (C-style), but tinygrad relies on
// Python floor-division/modulo. floor_div/floor_mod below reproduce Python's `//`/`%`
// exactly, and all of tinygrad's helpers that use `//`/`%` are ported on top of them.
